Treadle contains code derived from VisualBeef (Copyright 2026 AproposRobin, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0): the editor shell, the native host and the graph
editing model were forked from it and changed (docs/Editor-Model.md, section 8, lists what
was kept, removed and replaced).

This product includes software developed by third parties; see THIRD_PARTY.md.
The native host Native/bin/win64/treadlehost.dll (built from Native/host and Native/third_party)
statically links Dear ImGui, cimgui, imnodes, cimnodes (MIT), SDL2 (zlib), the LLVM C++ runtime
(Apache-2.0 with LLVM Exceptions) and the mingw-w64 runtime;
Native/bin/linux64/libtreadlehost.so links the same ImGui/imnodes code and loads SDL2 dynamically.
Their notices are in THIRD_PARTY.md and must accompany any distribution of those binaries.
